@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Guarded work creation, assignment and transition
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Authorized participant" as U
participant "Work handler" as H
participant "Identity / current membership" as A
participant "Work policy / current state" as P
database "Owned work / board / command result" as D
U -> H : explicit create/assignment or move intent + expected versions
H -> A : current exact project/action eligibility
A --> H : scoped context / denial
H -> P : validate relationship, assignee eligibility or transition/criteria
P --> H : eligible candidate / conflict / invalid
alt actual guarded conditions satisfied
 H -> D : revalidate relevant current guards and same-intent identity\ncommit coherent work state + placement + result
 D --> H : actual committed / conflict / unknown result
 H --> U : permitted truthful outcome
else denied / stale / invalid
 H --> U : safe refusal / conflict; protected state preserved
end
note over H,D
 Early check alone cannot settle membership revocation races.
 Lost response resolves same command identity.
 No implicit mail, search index, workflow, acceptance or deployment effect.
end note

@enduml